OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers scared about bluetongue
OL,4,Avaccine shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer in Shropshire says he is
OL,7,Fworried for animals across the country
OL,8,Fbecause of the spread of an outbreak of
OL,9,Fthe potentially fatal bluetongue virus
OL,10,Famid a vaccine shortage.
OL,12,FRichard Yates, from Middleton Scriven
OL,13,Fnear Bridgnorth, at first only
OL,14,Fvaccinated his cattle, but once cases
OL,15,Fstarted to rise in the South West, he
OL,16,Fjabbed his sheep.
OL,18,FIt is now "extremely difficult to get
OL,19,Fthe vaccine", he said and warned
OL,20,Ffarmers could be faced with
OL,21,F"considerable losses" if their animals
OL,22,Fdied from the outbreak,.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
