OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers scared about bluetongue
OL,4,Avaccine shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Environment Food and
OL,7,FRural Affairs (Defra) said it was
OL,8,F"working closely with the industry and
OL,9,Fis putting processes in for additional
OL,10,Fvaccine supplies".
